OL,3,GNEWSADouble murderer jailed for further
OL,4,A22 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man serving a life sentence for the
OL,7,Fmurder of two young men has been jailed
OL,8,Ffor a further 22 years for sexually
OL,9,Fassaulting three young naval recruits
OL,10,Fand a 14-year-old boy in the 1990s.
OL,12,FAllan Grimson, a former Royal Navy
OL,13,Fpetty officer, was sentenced in 2001
OL,14,Ffor the murders of Nicholas Wright and
OL,15,FSion Jenkins in the late 1990s.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
