OL,3,GNEWSADouble murderer jailed for further
OL,4,A22 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 67-year-old, from Portsmouth,
OL,7,FHampshire, was convicted following a
OL,8,Ftrial in July of the rape and indecent
OL,9,Fassault of a teenage naval rating, and
OL,10,Findecent assault charges against three
OL,11,Fother males, dating between February
OL,12,F1994 and November 1999.
OL,14,FJudge Paul Dugdale told Grimson he
OL,15,Fremained a "significant risk to members
OL,16,Fof the general public of serious harm".
